  "description": "Hyeon-U Gwak and Jae-Ryeong Jo are members of the National Assembly of South Korea with strong careers ahead of them. They are members of opposing parties and talk each other down in public debates, but at home, they’re a married couple with a lovely seven-year-old daughter! Things get hectic when it turns out that their respective parties have chosen them as presidential candidates. Can they navigate the challenges that lie ahead both in their careers and at home as they run as rivals in a presidential race, and political schemes begin to cloud the horizon?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
